%% Public edit rollback sequence
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor Caller as Application code
  participant API as CanvasEditPort
  participant EK as EditKernel
  participant Store as DocumentStoreKernel
  participant Selection as SelectionKernel
  participant Sparse as Sparse edit journal
  participant Draft as DraftDocument
  participant Handle as CanvasEdit handle
  participant Touched as TouchedSet
  participant CC as CommitCompiler
  participant Effects as Buffered effects
  participant Signals as Public state/effects

  Caller->>API: edit(fn)
  API->>EK: open synchronous edit session
  EK->>EK: reject disposed or nested edit
  EK->>Handle: bind live handle to session
  EK-->>Caller: invoke fn(handle)

  alt callback throws
    activate Handle
    Caller->>Handle: document/resource mutations or setSelection intent
    opt document/resource mutation
      Handle->>Sparse: open Store facts/selection snapshot and record mutation
      Sparse->>Touched: record exact sparse mutation facts
      opt explicit draft read or replacement
        Handle->>Draft: promote sparse journal into draft
        Draft->>Touched: record materialized fallback facts
      end
    end
    opt setSelection intent
      Handle->>Handle: retain pending desired-selection snapshot
    end
    Caller--x EK: throw original exception
    deactivate Handle
    EK->>EK: capture original exception
  else callback returns Future
    Caller-->>EK: Future result
    EK->>EK: reject async edit before commit planning
    Note over EK: Returned Future is treated as a rollback path and no async mutation may outlive the session.
  else preflight fails before atomic install
    activate Handle
    Caller->>Handle: document/resource mutations or setSelection intent
    opt document/resource mutation
      Handle->>Sparse: open Store facts/selection snapshot and record mutation
      Sparse->>Touched: record exact sparse mutation facts
      opt explicit draft read or replacement
        Handle->>Draft: promote sparse journal into draft
        Draft->>Touched: record materialized fallback facts
      end
    end
    opt setSelection intent
      Handle->>Handle: retain pending desired-selection snapshot
    end
    Handle-->>Caller: mutation results
    deactivate Handle
    Caller-->>EK: callback result
    EK->>EK: reject Future result before success path
    EK->>Store: prepare sparse/materialized accepted candidate when applicable
    alt Store candidate preflight fails
      Store--x EK: candidate error
    else accepted candidate reaches compiled plan
      Store-->>EK: accepted final document facts
      EK->>CC: compile touched set and invalidation candidates
      Touched-->>CC: exact changed state
      CC->>Applier: hand off compiled CommitPlan
      Applier->>Applier: materialize accepted document and seal delivery/action inputs
      Applier->>Selection: prepare equality, final revision, and transfer backing
      Applier->>Store: prevalidate freshness, final revisions, and ID admission backings
      Applier--x EK: selection, sealing, freshness, or ownership error before either assignment-only installer
    end
  end

  EK->>Effects: discard buffered events, repaint, resources, spatial, and projection effects
  EK->>Draft: discard draft
  EK->>Touched: discard touched set
  EK->>Handle: discard pending desired-selection intent, close session, and mark handle stale
  Note over Handle: Any later handle operation throws StateError.
  Note over EK,Selection: Selection owner, selection revision, and prepared backing ownership remain unchanged or released without installation.
  Note over EK,Store: Committed document identity, all document revisions, and all ID admissions remain unchanged. InteractionEngine-owned preview is outside Store.
  Note over Store,Signals: No atomic install runs and no action event, text edit event, public state publication, scene repaint, or overlay repaint is published.
  EK--x API: rethrow original exception, async edit rejection, or preflight error
  API--x Caller: propagate safely
